<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8">
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,minimum-scale=1,initial-scale=1">
		<style type="text/css">	
			body{
				font-family:Arial, Ciutadella;
				line-height:20px;
				font-size:14px; 
				color:#666666;
			}
			td{
				font-family:Arial, Ciutadella;
				line-height:20px;
				font-size:14px;
				color:#666666;
			}
			p{
				font-family:Arial, Ciutadella;
				line-height:20px;
				font-size:14px;
				padding:0;
				margin:2px 0 2px 0;
				color:#666666;
			}
			#main-content sup{
				font-family:Arial, Ciutadella;
				font-size:11px; 
				bottom: 1ex; 
				vertical-align: 1px; 
				position: relative;
			}
			hr{ 
				display: block;
				border: 0;
				border-top: 1px solid #DADADA;
				padding: 0; 
				border-color: #DADADA;
				background-color: #DADADA;
				color: #DADADA;
			}
			#t&c sup{
				font-family:Arial, Ciutadella;
				font-size:9px; 
				bottom: 1ex; 
				vertical-align: 1px; 
				position: relative;
			}
			a{
				color: #666666 !important;
				text-decoration: underline;
				border:0;
			}
			h1{
				font-size:28px; 
				color: #161616; 
				line-height:32px;
			}
			h2{
				font-size:22px; 
				color: #161616; 
				line-height:26px;
			}
			h3{
				font-size:18px; 
				color: #161616; 
				line-height:22px;
			}
			ul{
				list-style-image: url('http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018381149/list-bullet-icon3.png');
				padding: 0px 15px 2px 25px;
				margin: 0;
			}
			ol{ 
				color:#E40000;
				padding: 0px 15px 2px 25px;
				margin: 0;
			}			
			li, li span{
				padding: 0px 0px 2px 5px;
				font-family:Arial, Ciutadella;
				line-height:20px;
				font-size:14px;
				color:#666666;	
			}
			@media only screen and (max-width: 480px) {
				body + table {
					width:480px !important;
				}
				#emailContainer {
					width:460px !important;
				}
				.templateColumnContainer{
					width:100% !important;
					display:block !important;
				}
				#bodyTable{
					width:460px !important;
				}
				ul{
					list-style-image: url('http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018381150/list-bullet-icon3m.png');
				}
			}		
		</style>
		<title>
			Qantas
		</title>
		<link href="http://www.qantas.com.au/img/icons/favicon.ico" rel="shortcut icon" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<table align="center" style="background-color:#F4F5F6; width:740px;" width="740">
			<tbody>
				<tr>
					<td>
						<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="bodyTable" style="line-height:23pt; font-family:Arial, Ciutadella; font-size:10px; background-color:#F4F5F6;" width="680">
							<tbody>
								<tr style="height:60px; text-align:center;">
									<td align="center" colspan="5" style="text-align:center;">
									    <div style="font-size:1px; color:#F4F5F6; line-height:1px; opacity:0; overflow:hidden; height:20px; width:680px; display:block;"><br>   &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>
										<div style="display:block; font-size:10px; height:13px; font-family:Arial, Ciutadella; text-align:center;"></div> 
										<div style="display:block; height:15px;">&nbsp;</div>
									</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td align="center" valign="top">
										<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="emailContainer" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;" width="680">
											<tbody>												
												<tr>
													<td align="center" valign="top">
														<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-image">
															<tbody>
																<!--<tr>
																	<td align="center" colspan="1">
																		<img alt="Qantas" border="0" height="70" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2013300744/device-top.jpg" title="Qantas" width="680" />
																	</td>
																</tr>-->
																<tr>
																	<td align="center" colspan="1">
																		<img alt="Qantas" border="0" height="400"  width="680" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2019412289/1710_QBR_AMEX_triple_points_start.jpg" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas"/>
																	</td>
																</tr>
															</tbody>
														</table>
													</td>
												</tr>
												<tr id="main-content">
													<td align="center" valign="top">
														<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" id="emailBody" style="color: #666666; font-family:Arial, Ciutadella; font-size:14px; line-height:20px;" width="90%">
															<tbody>
																<tr>
																	<td align="left" colspan="3" valign="top">
																		&nbsp;
																	</td>
																</tr>
																<tr>
																	<td align="left" colspan="3" style="color: #666666; font-family:Arial, Ciutadella; font-size:14px; line-height:20px;" valign="top">
																		Hi,
																	</td>
																</tr>															
																<tr>
																	<td align="left" colspan="3" style="color: #666666; font-family:Arial, Ciutadella; font-size:14px; line-height:20px;" valign="top">
																		Thank you for your interest in our American Express<sup style="font-size:11px; bottom: 1ex; vertical-align: 1px;">®</sup> Qantas Corporate Card.
																		<br><br>																	
																		Sign up to benefit from a complete corporate expense management solution which offers exclusive rewards for your company and its employees, streamlined cost management systems for bottom-line savings and greater control over expenses through a single-payment solution. As an American Express<sup style="font-size:11px; bottom: 1ex; vertical-align: 1px;">®</sup> Qantas Corporate account holder, you can enjoy the following benefits:  
																	</td>
																</tr>
																															
																<!-- Bulleted list starts here -->		
																<tr>
																	<td align="left" colspan="3" style="color: #666666; font-family:Arial, Ciutadella; font-size:14px; line-height:20px;" valign="top">
																		<table border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0">
																			<tr>
																				<td align="left" valign="top" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;">
																						<img style="margin:0; padding:0; border:none; display:block; width:30px; height:17px;" width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png" />
																					</div>
																				</td>
																				<td style="padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;">Earn TRIPLE Qantas Points through you Qantas Business Rewards program.</div>
																				</td>
																			</tr>
																		</table>
																		<table border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0">
																			<tr>
																				<td align="left" valign="top" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;">
																						<img style="margin:0; padding:0; border:none; display:block; width:30px; height:17px;" width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png"/>
																					</div>
																				</td>
																				<td style="padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;">Access to the Membership Rewards Spirit program – Spirit Reward points can be transferred to Qantas Frequent Flyer points at a ratio of 1:1.</div>
																				</td>
																			</tr>
																		</table>
																		<table border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0">
																			<tr>
																				<td align="left" valign="top" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;">
																						<img style="margin:0; padding:0; border:none; display:block; width:30px; height:17px;" width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png"/>
																					</div>
																				</td>
																				<td style="padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;">Discount on the Qantas Club annual fee when four or more employees join Qantas Club.</div>
																				</td>
																			</tr>
																		</table>
																		<table border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0">
																			<tr>
																				<td align="left" valign="top" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;">
																						<img style="margin:0; padding:0; border:none; display:block; width:30px; height:17px;" width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png"/>
																					</div>
																				</td>
																				<td style="padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;">Up to 51 cash flow days.</div>
																				</td>
																			</tr>
																		</table>
																		<table border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0">
																			<tr>
																				<td align="left" valign="top" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;">
																						<img style="margin:0; padding:0; border:none; display:block; width:30px; height:17px;" width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png"/>
																					</div>
																				</td>
																				<td style="padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;">Access to an online program management tool, American Express<sup style="font-size:11px; font-size:11px; bottom: 1ex; vertical-align: 1px;">®</sup> @Work.</div>
																				</td>
																			</tr>
																		</table>
																		<table border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0">
																			<tr>
																				<td align="left" valign="top" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;">
																						<img style="margin:0; padding:0; border:none; display:block; width:30px; height:17px;" width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png"/>
																					</div>
																				</td>
																				<td style="padding: 0px;">
																					<div style="padding: 0px; margin:2px 0 2px 0;">Member rates on Qantas Meeting Rooms.</div>
																				</td>
																			</tr>
																		</table>
																	</td>
																</tr>

																<tr>
																	<td align="left" colspan="3" style="color: #666666; font-family:Arial, Ciutadella; font-size:14px; line-height:20px;" valign="top">
																		To discuss the American Express<sup style="font-size:11px; font-size:11px; bottom: 1ex; vertical-align: 1px;">®</sup> Qantas Corporate Card program, an American Express<sup style="font-size:11px; font-size:11px; bottom: 1ex; vertical-align: 1px;">®</sup> Card Specialist can contact you to explain the program in more detail and provide details about the extra rewards that you will receive.  
																		<br><br>																		
																		Please advise if you would like me to organise this, and an American Express<sup style="font-size:11px; font-size:11px; bottom: 1ex; vertical-align: 1px;">®</sup> Card Specialist can contact you at a time that suits you best.<br><br>
																		Kind Regards,
																	</td>
																</tr>
															
