																	<td align="left" colspan="3" style="color: #666666; font-family:Arial, Ciutadella; font-size:14px; line-height:20px;" valign="top">																	 
																		<a style="height:40px; width:135px;" href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/benefits" target="_blank"><img alt="Discover benefits" border="0" height="40" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2012225364/discover-benefits.jpg" title="Discover benefits" width="135" /></a>
